Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}なんだか　汚いとこだなぁ。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得这地方好脏啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}ヒャ～！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀～！
