Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}うぉ～　すげえ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.35,0:08:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}ホッホッホ…　驚いたか。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嚯嚯嚯……吓到了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.05,0:08:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}この木像はの　わしが魂を込めて\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座木像，是老夫倾注灵魂
